# Omnichat

## Description

This is a llm chat app that allows user to select LLM models by their own with following features:

### Main Chatscreen
- A main chat screen that interact with user with LLM resonponses
- If the selected model is a resoning model, the chat allows user to open/collapse a accordion that displays the thinking part of llm response3. 
- The input area allows user to upload files (textfiles and images)
- There should be a animating indicator to let user know these informations: 1. Waiting for response 2. Thinking(If there is any) 3. Finished

### Leftside Menu
- App name "Omnichat" on the top
- This Menu should be a drawer style, user can collapse and open the menu
- User can select available models from the bottom down menu, also user should enter their own API keys.
- User can create new chat and select a particular chat history
- User can set a system prompt

## Tech Stacks
- This app is written in Next.js
- React component libraies: 
  1. Tailwindcss
  2. Shadcn
  3. Framer-motion
  4. Lucide

## Design Paradigm
- Minimal design with interactive and smooth animated experience.